---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const breadcrumbSchema={"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://www.stairwaymortgage.com/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Oregon Privacy"}]};
---

<Layout title="Oregon Privacy Rights & Data Protection | Stairway" description="Your privacy rights under Oregon state law. How we collect use and protect your personal information with full transparency." canonical="https://www.stairwaymortgage.com/oregon-privacy/">
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(breadcrumbSchema)} />
  <nav class="container-page ft-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">Home</a> <span>/</span> <span>Oregon Privacy</span>
  </nav>
  <header class="container-prose ft-header">
    <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-blue mb-4">Legal</span>
    <h1 class="display-md">Oregon Privacy Notice</h1>
  </header>
  <article class="container-prose prose-editorial ft-body">
    <p>This notice supplements the Stairway Mortgage Privacy Policy and applies to Oregon residents under the Oregon Consumer Privacy Act (&ldquo;OCPA&rdquo;). It is issued by NEXA Mortgage LLC (NMLS #1660690), doing business as Stairway Mortgage. Last updated: October 24, 2026.</p>

    <p>Information covered by the Gramm-Leach-Bliley Act or the Fair Credit Reporting Act, including most mortgage application and credit information, is protected under those laws and our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>, not the OCPA. This notice covers the rest, such as website visits, app use, quote requests, marketing and advertising.</p>

    <p><strong>Your rights.</strong> Oregon residents may:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>confirm whether we process your personal data and get a copy of it;</li>
      <li>get a list of the specific third parties we have disclosed personal data to;</li>
      <li>correct inaccurate personal data;</li>
      <li>delete personal data, subject to legal exceptions; and</li>
      <li>opt out of targeted advertising, the sale of personal data, and profiling that produces legal or similarly significant effects.</li>
    </ul>

    <p><strong>What we do.</strong> We collect and use personal data as described in our Privacy Policy. We do not sell personal data for money. We use website and app tags and hashed customer lists with advertising platforms such as Meta and Google to show you our own ads, which the OCPA treats as targeted advertising. We do not use automated profiling to make lending decisions; lenders make those decisions. We process sensitive data, such as race and ethnicity collected for federal reporting, only as the law requires or with your consent.</p>

    <p><strong>How to make a request.</strong> Email <strong><a href="mailto:privacy@stairwaymortgage.com">privacy@stairwaymortgage.com</a></strong> or call <a href="tel:+19549931625">(954) 993-1625</a>. To opt out of targeted advertising, use the <a href="/do-not-sell-or-share/">Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information</a> link at the bottom of our website; we also honor a Global Privacy Control signal from your browser. You may use an authorized agent. We verify requests before acting and respond within 45 days, with up to 45 more days when reasonably necessary, in which case we will tell you why.</p>

    <p><strong>Appeals.</strong> If we deny your request, reply to our decision or email <a href="mailto:privacy@stairwaymortgage.com">privacy@stairwaymortgage.com</a> with &ldquo;Appeal&rdquo; in the subject. We respond to appeals within 45 days. If you disagree with our answer, you may contact the <a href="https://www.doj.state.or.us/consumer-protection/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Oregon Department of Justice</a>.</p>

    <p><strong>Contact.</strong> <a href="mailto:privacy@stairwaymortgage.com">privacy@stairwaymortgage.com</a> &middot; <a href="tel:+19549931625">(954) 993-1625</a> &middot; NEXA Mortgage LLC dba Stairway Mortgage, 5559 S Sossaman Rd, Bldg 1, Ste 101, Mesa, AZ 85212.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .ft-breadcrumb { font-family:var(--stw-mono, 'JetBrains Mono'), monospace; font-size:12px; color:var(--color-mute); padding-top:2rem; padding-bottom:1.25rem; }
  .ft-breadcrumb a { color:var(--color-mute); text-decoration:none; } .ft-breadcrumb a:hover { color:var(--color-blue); }
  .ft-breadcrumb span { margin-inline:0.4rem; opacity:0.5; }
  .ft-header { padding-top:0.5rem; padding-bottom:1rem; }
  .ft-body { margin-top:1.5rem; padding-bottom:4rem; }
  .ft-body :global(h2) { font-family:var(--stw-display, 'Fraunces'), Georgia, serif; font-weight:500; font-size:clamp(1.4rem,2.5vw,1.9rem); margin-top:2.5rem; margin-bottom:1rem; }
  .ft-body :global(h3) { font-family:var(--stw-display, 'Fraunces'), Georgia, serif; font-weight:500; font-size:1.3rem; margin-top:1.75rem; margin-bottom:0.7rem; }
  .ft-body :global(h2 b),.ft-body :global(h3 b) { font-weight:inherit; }
  .ft-body :global(p) { font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:1.1rem; color:var(--color-ink-light); }
  .ft-body :global(ul),.ft-body :global(ol) { margin:0 0 1.4rem 1.25rem; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0.45rem; }
  .ft-body :global(a) { color:var(--color-blue); text-decoration:underline; text-underline-offset:2px; }
  .ft-body :global(img) { max-width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:10px; margin:1.5rem 0; }
  .ft-body :global(table) { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:1.5rem 0; font-size:14px; }
  .ft-body :global(th),.ft-body :global(td) { border:1px solid var(--color-bone); padding:0.6rem 0.8rem; text-align:left; }
  .ft-body :global(th) { background:var(--color-paper-tint); font-weight:600; }
</style>
